{"id": "q_longmont_session_12_council_chamber_roster", "question": "Who's actually in the council chamber for the Session 12 fight with the Wolf?", "answer": "TL;DR: The chamber contains the **Council members** and **Bonogo**, with **the Wolf** as the target of the fight; **Stafl may also be present** based on setup, but cultists are not indicated to be in the chamber.\n\nBased on OBSERVED facts:\n- **Council (npc)**: The fight occurs in the **Council Chamber**, where the **Emergency Council of Mirathorn** is actively meeting under tension and time pressure. They are definitively present.\n- **Bonogo**: Explicitly **“Chasing/attacking Wolf”** and **“Attacks Wolf from behind”**, plus **“Dealing major damage to Wolf”**, placing Bonogo in the chamber during the fight.\n- **Stafl**: PREP/OBSERVED role includes **“Set up to distract Wolf”**, suggesting presence, but not as definitively confirmed in-chamber as Bonogo.\n- **Cultists**: OBSERVED locations place them in **warehouses, tunnels, and other areas**, not the council chamber.\n\nNo conflicting facts override this.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Location: Council Chamber (central HQ, warded, under tension)\n- Active participants: Council members, Bonogo\n- Likely participant: Stafl (setup role)\n- Not present: Cultists (located elsewhere)", "has_error": false, "retrieval": {"enabled": true, "top_k": 30, "pre_filter_count": 2069, "post_filter_count": 61, "duration_ms": 38, "top_5": [["ent_council", 1.4944], ["ent_eirik", 1.3656], ["ent_the_wolf", 1.0456], ["ent_sewer", 1.0017], ["ent_secret_escape_tunnel", 1.0]], "selected_entity_ids": ["ent_council", "ent_eirik", "ent_the_wolf", "ent_sewer", "ent_secret_escape_tunnel", "ent_amulet_of_protection", "ent_torbin_jove", "ent_the_fight", "ent_city_guard", "ent_commander_thalia_ashenvale", "ent_amulets_of_council", "ent_magic_pulse_alarms", "ent_heavy_iron_shutters", "ent_magical_defenses", "ent_session_10_battle_with_the_meat_monsters", "ent_side_chamber", "ent_moment_of_decision"